Generated files: do not edit them here.

This folder holds the built DrawSplay virtual display driver (DrawSplayIdd.dll,
.inf and .cat) that the Windows host embeds with go:embed and installs at run
time. The .inf here is the stamped build output of
drivers/windows/idd/DrawSplayIdd.inf (DriverVer and the architecture filled in).

To change the driver, edit drivers/windows/idd/ and run
scripts/build-idd-driver.ps1, which builds it and copies the result here.
The .dll is not committed (see .gitignore); release builds produce it.
